1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,315
欢迎回来
Welcome back.

2
00:00:01,365 --> 00:00:04,128
我们在 transcribe audio 这个 container 里
We're inside the transcribe audio container,

3
00:00:04,128 --> 00:00:06,891
Python 还找不到 Google 的包
and Python can't find Google's packages yet.

4
00:00:07,133 --> 00:00:10,602
第 7 步：README 列出了三个要加的包
Step 7: the README lists three packages to add,

5
00:00:10,602 --> 00:00:13,554
所以用一条 uv add 命令把三个一起加上
so type all three in one uv add command.

6
00:00:13,874 --> 00:00:15,474
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

7
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:20,346
要了 3 个包，装了 26 个
Three packages asked for, and 26 installed.

8
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:24,794
和第 1 讲一样，每个包都会带来自己的依赖
As in lecture 1, each package brings its own dependencies,

9
00:00:24,794 --> 00:00:27,001
uv 会解析整棵依赖树
and uv resolves the whole tree.

10
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,871
那这些东西都去了哪儿？
But where did everything land?

11
00:00:29,191 --> 00:00:34,221
清单 pyproject.toml 和小票 uv.lock 都在 /app 里
The list, pyproject.toml, and the receipt, uv.lock, sit in /app,

12
00:00:34,221 --> 00:00:36,893
所以它们直接写进了你的笔记本
so they're written to your laptop.

13
00:00:37,213 --> 00:00:40,326
而那 26 个包进了 /home 下的 venv
The 26 packages went into the venv in /home,

14
00:00:40,326 --> 00:00:42,802
落在 container 那层用完就扔的可写层上
on the container's throwaway layer.

15
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,643
两个额外检查
Two extra checks.

16
00:00:44,693 --> 00:00:48,945
这个 pyproject.toml 现在列出了这三个包
The pyproject.toml now lists the three packages,

17
00:00:48,945 --> 00:00:51,071
每个都带版本下限
each with a lower bound,

18
00:00:51,071 --> 00:00:56,475
cli.py 旁边多了一个约 138 KB 的新 uv.lock
and a new uv.lock of about 138 kilobytes sits next to cli.py,

19
00:00:56,475 --> 00:00:58,075
所有者是用户 app
owned by user app.

20
00:00:58,317 --> 00:01:04,781
再加一个额外检查：venv 变量是 /home/app/.venv，在窗外
Another extra: the venv variable says /home/app/.venv, outside the window.

21
00:01:05,017 --> 00:01:06,396
补充两句
Two asides.

22
00:01:06,446 --> 00:01:11,844
这个包叫 ffmpeg-python；单单一个 ffmpeg 是另一个项目
The package is ffmpeg-python; plain ffmpeg is another project.

23
00:01:12,164 --> 00:01:13,925
还有，如果你用的是 Linux 笔记本
And on a Linux laptop

24
00:01:13,925 --> 00:01:19,866
目录又不属于用户 ID 1000，uv add 会报 permission denied
whose folder isn't owned by user ID 1000, uv add fails with permission denied:

25
00:01:19,866 --> 00:01:22,745
屏幕上的 chown 命令能修好它
the chown command on screen fixes it.

26
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:27,815
README 里还说：退出以后，要重新构建 image
The README adds: when you exit, rebuild the image.

27
00:01:28,135 --> 00:01:30,468
我们最后再做这一步，到时候就知道为什么了
We'll do that at the end, and see why.

28
00:01:30,518 --> 00:01:32,352
第 8 步：设置你的组名
Step 8: set your group name.

29
00:01:32,672 --> 00:01:36,324
在你的笔记本上，用 VS Code 打开 cli.py
On your laptop, in VS Code, open cli.py

30
00:01:36,324 --> 00:01:39,976
把第 21 行改成你们组的名字
and change line 21 to your team's name;

31
00:01:39,976 --> 00:01:41,576
我们的是 group-01
ours is group-01.

32
00:01:41,888 --> 00:01:43,488
暂停一下，把它改好
Pause and make the change.

33
00:01:43,683 --> 00:01:46,874
在 container 里，额外的 grep 已经显示出新的那一行
Inside, an extra grep already shows the new line:

34
00:01:46,874 --> 00:01:48,632
这扇窗两边都是通的
the window works both ways.

35
00:01:48,952 --> 00:01:52,238
五个 cli.py 文件里都要用同一个名字
Use the same name in all five cli.py files,

36
00:01:52,238 --> 00:01:55,523
不然各个阶段就找不到彼此的成果
or the stages won't find each other's work.

37
00:01:55,767 --> 00:01:59,415
第 9 步：python cli.py --help
Step 9: python cli.py --help.

38
00:01:59,735 --> 00:02:03,554
这次成功了，而且和 README 里那段逐行一致
This time it works, and it matches the README's block line for line.

39
00:02:03,874 --> 00:02:05,601
暂停一下，跟到这一步
Pause, and get to this point.

40
00:02:07,450 --> 00:02:14,831
第 10 步下载录音：python cli.py --download，简写是 -d
Step 10 downloads the recordings: python cli.py --download, or -d for short.

41
00:02:15,151 --> 00:02:18,842
我们录制的机器上没有密钥，所以这里看到的是缺密钥时的样子
Our machine had no key, so here's what a missing key looks like.

42
00:02:19,083 --> 00:02:22,774
它先打印出参数和 download 这个词，然后是一段 traceback
It printed the arguments and the word download, then a traceback.

43
00:02:23,094 --> 00:02:26,734
最后一行是 DefaultCredentialsError
The last line says DefaultCredentialsError:

44
00:02:26,734 --> 00:02:30,966
找不到 secrets/mega-pipeline.json 这个文件
the file secrets/mega-pipeline.json was not found.

45
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,928
按第 1 讲的方法来读
Read it as in lecture 1.

46
00:02:33,248 --> 00:02:36,341
我们的代码在第 36 行创建了一个 storage 客户端
Our code, line 36, built a storage client.

47
00:02:36,661 --> 00:02:40,014
客户端向 Google 的认证库要凭据
The client asked Google's auth library for credentials,

48
00:02:40,014 --> 00:02:42,635
认证库就去找一个不存在的文件
and that library looked for a missing file.

49
00:02:42,883 --> 00:02:44,547
正常情况下，链条是这样的
Here's the chain when it works.

50
00:02:44,867 --> 00:02:49,987
你的代码从来不传密钥：客户端会去问 Google 的认证库“我是谁”
Your code never passes the key: the client asks Google's auth library who it is.

51
00:02:50,307 --> 00:02:54,756
这个查找过程叫应用默认凭据，简称 ADC
That search is called application default credentials, or ADC,

52
00:02:54,756 --> 00:02:58,201
它的第一站就是第 10 行的那个变量
and its first stop is the variable from line 10.

53
00:02:58,450 --> 00:03:00,852
这个变量就是一个路标
That variable is a signpost:

54
00:03:00,852 --> 00:03:06,599
secrets/mega-pipeline.json，从当前目录 /app 算起
secrets/mega-pipeline.json, starting from the current folder, /app.

55
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:09,927
透过这扇窗，它指向你笔记本上的密钥
Through the window, it leads to the key on your laptop.

56
00:03:10,317 --> 00:03:14,041
认证库用密钥生成一个短期有效的访问令牌
From the key, the library makes a short-lived access token,

57
00:03:14,041 --> 00:03:16,503
每个发给 Google 的请求都带着它
and every request to Google carries it.

58
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:19,587
接着 Google 会检查两次，README 里也这么说
Google then checks twice, as the README says.

59
00:03:19,907 --> 00:03:25,800
身份验证问的是谁在调用，密钥说是课程的服务账号
Authentication asks who is calling, and the key says it's the course's service account;

60
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:30,745
授权问的是它有没有权限做这件事，IAM 角色为它打开了 bucket
authorization asks whether it may do this, and IAM roles open the bucket.

61
00:03:30,983 --> 00:03:33,159
这个报错通常有三个原因
This error has three usual causes.

62
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:36,745
要么密钥不在这个组件的 secrets 目录里
The key isn't in this component's secrets folder,

63
00:03:36,745 --> 00:03:39,211
要么你 cd 离开了 /app
you changed directory away from /app,

64
00:03:39,211 --> 00:03:42,610
要么你在笔记本上错误的目录里跑了 docker run
or you ran docker run from the wrong laptop folder.

65
00:03:46,550 --> 00:03:49,112
一个额外检查：就连这次失败的运行
One extra check: even this failed run

66
00:03:49,112 --> 00:03:52,505
也在你笔记本上建了两个目录，input audios
created two folders on your laptop, input audios,

67
00:03:52,505 --> 00:03:55,275
还有里面带着你们组目录的 text prompts
and text prompts with your group inside.

68
00:03:55,595 --> 00:03:58,219
代码是在创建客户端之前建好它们的
The code makes them before it builds the client.

69
00:03:59,267 --> 00:04:04,113
有密钥的话，要找的是 download 这个词、每段录音一个对象名
With your key, look for the word download, one object name per recording,

70
00:04:04,113 --> 00:04:08,163
还有出现在你笔记本上 input audios 里的音频文件
and the audio files appearing in input audios on your laptop.

71
00:04:08,483 --> 00:04:11,320
暂停一下，确认密钥在 secrets 目录里，然后跑一遍
Pause, check your key is in secrets, and run it.

72
00:04:13,867 --> 00:04:15,616
第 11 步是转写
Step 11 transcribes.

73
00:04:15,936 --> 00:04:20,601
对每段录音，ffmpeg 都先把 MP3 转成 FLAC
For each recording, ffmpeg first converts the MP3 into FLAC,

74
00:04:20,601 --> 00:04:24,256
所以构建参数里要有 ffmpeg
and that's why ffmpeg is in the build argument.

75
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:27,081
音频的字节就放在请求里一起发过去
The audio bytes travel inside the request.

76
00:04:27,401 --> 00:04:31,382
长时间运行的 recognize 调用会马上交回一个操作对象
The long-running recognize call hands back an operation at once,

77
00:04:31,382 --> 00:04:32,834
就像一张取件单
like a ticket stub.

78
00:04:32,884 --> 00:04:36,810
然后它的 result 调用最多等 90 秒，等转写文本回来
Its result call then waits up to 90 seconds for the transcript.

79
00:04:37,317 --> 00:04:42,861
长音频是分段返回的，所以第 84 到 91 行把每一段拼起来
Long audio comes back in pieces, so lines 84 to 91 join every piece;

80
00:04:42,861 --> 00:04:45,552
这正是最新那个 commit 修好的
that was the latest commit's fix.

81
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:50,237
输入 python cli.py --transcribe，或者 -t
Type python cli.py --transcribe, or -t.

82
00:04:50,557 --> 00:04:53,170
要找的是 Transcribing 加一个文件名
Look for Transcribing and a file name,

83
00:04:53,170 --> 00:04:56,403
ffmpeg 的日志、响应，还有转写文本
ffmpeg's log, the response, and the transcript.

84
00:04:56,723 --> 00:04:58,821
如果报 No such file
If it says no such file,

85
00:04:58,821 --> 00:05:02,931
后面是 ffmpeg，就把 ffmpeg 加到第 3 行，然后退出、重新构建
ffmpeg, add ffmpeg to line 3, exit and rebuild.

86
00:05:03,167 --> 00:05:07,189
然后打开 text prompts 下 group-01 里那个新的文本文件
Then open the new text file under text prompts, group-01,

87
00:05:07,189 --> 00:05:08,642
就在你的笔记本上
on your laptop.

88
00:05:08,692 --> 00:05:11,665
如果里面是 None，说明 Speech-to-Text 什么也没返回
If it says None, Speech-to-Text returned nothing:

89
00:05:11,665 --> 00:05:15,732
删掉它，重新转写，因为转写过的文件会被跳过
delete it and transcribe again, because finished files are skipped.

90
00:05:15,967 --> 00:05:20,852
第 12 步：python cli.py --upload，或者 -u
Step 12: python cli.py --upload, or -u.

91
00:05:21,172 --> 00:05:26,018
它只上传 input 开头的文件，在 bucket 里也用同样的名字
It uploads only files starting with input, under the same name in the bucket:

92
00:05:26,018 --> 00:05:30,047
要找的是 Uploading，后面是 text prompts、你们组和文件名
look for Uploading, then text prompts, your group, and the file.

93
00:05:30,284 --> 00:05:32,938
你的转写文本会落进你们组的抽屉
Your transcript drops into your group's drawer,

94
00:05:32,938 --> 00:05:38,135
排行榜上转写那一格也会亮起来，README 里说的检查方法就是这个
and the transcribe cell lights up on the leaderboard, which is how the README says to check.

95
00:05:38,455 --> 00:05:41,100
暂停一下，用你的密钥把三步都跑一遍
Pause and run all three steps, with your key.

96
00:05:41,334 --> 00:05:44,213
额外提示一句：这些参数可以合在一起用
An extra tip: the flags combine,

97
00:05:44,213 --> 00:05:47,542
-d -t -u 会按顺序把三步都跑完
so -d -t -u runs all three, in order.

98
00:05:47,862 --> 00:05:50,144
每次调用都记在课程项目的账上
Each call is billed to the course project.

99
00:05:51,483 --> 00:05:53,936
第 13 步：退出，然后重新构建
Step 13: exit, and rebuild.

100
00:05:54,256 --> 00:05:58,605
输入 exit，container 就被删掉，连同用完就扔的可写层
Type exit, and the container is removed with its throwaway layer,

101
00:05:58,605 --> 00:06:00,678
26 个包也跟着没了
and the 26 packages go with it.

102
00:06:00,916 --> 00:06:03,262
回到笔记本上，做一个额外检查
Back on the laptop, an extra check:

103
00:06:03,262 --> 00:06:09,695
带三个依赖的 pyproject.toml、lock 文件和那两个新目录都还在
the pyproject.toml with three dependencies, the lock file, and the two new folders all survived,

104
00:06:09,695 --> 00:06:11,839
因为它们在这扇窗里
because they were in the window.

105
00:06:12,083 --> 00:06:15,411
而 git status 只显示 cli.py 改过了
Git status shows only cli.py as changed.

106
00:06:15,731 --> 00:06:18,462
其余的为什么看不见，我们最后再说
We'll see why the rest is invisible at the end.

107
00:06:18,700 --> 00:06:20,478
现在来看那个坑，这也是额外步骤
Now the trap, as an extra.

108
00:06:20,727 --> 00:06:23,924
用你之前构建的 image 起一个新的 container
Start a new container from the image you built earlier,

109
00:06:23,924 --> 00:06:25,524
再让它打印一次帮助
and ask for help again.

110
00:06:25,591 --> 00:06:27,497
又是 ModuleNotFoundError
It's ModuleNotFoundError again:

111
00:06:27,497 --> 00:06:30,262
那些包只存在于旧的 container 里
the packages lived only in the old container.

112
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:31,855
README 给的办法是
The README's fix:

113
00:06:31,855 --> 00:06:35,833
退出，然后用同一条 docker build 命令重新构建 image
exit, and rebuild the image with the same docker build command.

114
00:06:36,153 --> 00:06:37,500
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

115
00:06:37,550 --> 00:06:39,724
刚才那道题的答案，这次是真的
The ponder's answer, for real:

116
00:06:39,724 --> 00:06:45,229
构建步骤 2 和 3 用了缓存，构建步骤 4 复制改过的目录
build steps 2 and 3 are cached, while build step 4 copies the changed folder

117
00:06:45,229 --> 00:06:47,982
构建步骤 5，也就是 uv sync，重新运行
and build step 5, uv sync, runs again.

118
00:06:48,302 --> 00:06:50,072
这次构建不到 10 秒
The build took under ten seconds.

119
00:06:50,316 --> 00:06:53,656
完整日志显示了 uv sync 这次做了什么
The full log shows what uv sync did this time:

120
00:06:53,656 --> 00:06:56,124
复制那一步带进了 lock 文件
the copy brought in the lock file,

121
00:06:56,124 --> 00:07:00,044
uv 装上了同样的 26 个包，装进了 image 里
and uv installed the same 26 packages, into the image.

122
00:07:00,283 --> 00:07:01,769
再做两个额外检查
Two more extras.

123
00:07:01,819 --> 00:07:08,394
这个 image 涨到了 1.48 GB，docker history 每条指令列一行
The image grew to 1.48 gigabytes, and docker history lists one row per instruction:

124
00:07:08,394 --> 00:07:10,928
只写配置卡片的那几行显示 0 字节
card-only lines show zero bytes.

125
00:07:11,248 --> 00:07:17,755
现在 uv sync 那一层有 105 MB，是这些包加上 uv 的下载缓存
The uv sync layer now holds 105 megabytes, the packages plus uv's download cache.

126
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:22,857
现在新起的 container 不用 uv add 就能导入这三个包
And a fresh container now imports all three packages with no uv add at all:

127
00:07:22,857 --> 00:07:24,457
它们已经打包进 image 了
they're baked in.

128
00:07:24,983 --> 00:07:28,879
还有一点：因为复制那一步在 uv sync 前面
One more thing: because the copy comes before uv sync,

129
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:31,044
任何修改，哪怕只是组名
any edit, even the group name,

130
00:07:31,044 --> 00:07:34,434
都会像第 2 讲的多米诺骨牌一样，把 uv sync 也推倒
knocks over uv sync, like lecture 2's dominoes.

131
00:07:34,754 --> 00:07:39,660
后面的教程会先复制 pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock
Later tutorials copy pyproject.toml and uv.lock first.

132
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:46,049
组件 B，也就是 generate text，流程一样；我们会快一点
Component B, generate text, follows the same recipe; we'll go faster.

133
00:07:46,369 --> 00:07:47,614
第 1 和第 2 步
Steps 1 and 2:

134
00:07:47,614 --> 00:07:51,809
cd 进它的目录，再把密钥复制到它的 secrets 目录里
cd into its folder, and copy the key into its secrets folder.

135
00:07:52,050 --> 00:07:57,174
额外看一眼：这个目录已经有自己的 pyproject.toml
An extra look: this folder already has its own pyproject.toml,

136
00:07:57,174 --> 00:08:01,885
两个包都列上了，还要求 Python 3.14 或更新
listing both packages and requiring Python 3.14 or newer.

137
00:08:02,205 --> 00:08:04,125
这个先放着，到第 13 步再说
Leave that until step 13.

138
00:08:04,367 --> 00:08:09,103
第一个意外：uv init 失败了，因为项目已经初始化过了
Surprise one: uv init fails: the project is already initialized.

139
00:08:09,423 --> 00:08:13,104
README 里还是让你跑它，这是一个小错误
The README still says to run it, a small mistake:

140
00:08:13,104 --> 00:08:16,484
跳过第 3 步，也别管那个遗留的 main.py
skip step 3, and ignore the leftover main.py.

141
00:08:16,733 --> 00:08:18,901
第 4 步：还是同样的 Dockerfile
Step 4: the same Dockerfile,

142
00:08:18,901 --> 00:08:24,242
只是第 3 行去掉了 ffmpeg，因为这个组件根本不碰音频
except line 3 drops ffmpeg, since this component never touches audio.

143
00:08:24,562 --> 00:08:26,739
把你的复制过来，改掉那一行
Copy yours and change that line.

144
00:08:26,983 --> 00:08:30,295
第 5 步构建它，那个大 RUN 会重新运行
Step 5 builds it, and the big RUN step runs again,

145
00:08:30,295 --> 00:08:33,276
因为它要装的软件包变了
because the package list it installs changed.

146
00:08:33,596 --> 00:08:34,933
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

147
00:08:34,983 --> 00:08:39,009
来想一想。这个 image 里是 Python 3.12
Ponder this. The image has Python 3.12;

148
00:08:39,009 --> 00:08:43,516
这个 pyproject.toml 却要求 3.14 或更新
this pyproject.toml asks for 3.14 or newer.

149
00:08:43,836 --> 00:08:45,607
那 venv 会用哪个 Python？
Which Python will the venv use?

150
00:08:54,450 --> 00:08:57,360
第二个意外：实时视图里看不到
Surprise two: the live view hides it;

151
00:08:57,360 --> 00:09:01,451
完整日志里能看到：uv 下载了它自己的 Python
the full log shows it: uv downloaded its own Python,

152
00:09:01,451 --> 00:09:06,013
录制时是 3.15.0，并用它建了 venv
3.15.0 at the time of recording, and built the venv on it.

153
00:09:06,250 --> 00:09:09,600
这个 image 里的 3.12 落在范围之外
The image's 3.12 falls outside the interval,

154
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:14,015
所以 uv 去下载了范围内最新的 Python，和第 2 讲一样
so uv fetched the newest Python in range, as in lecture 2.

155
00:09:14,250 --> 00:09:19,347
第 6 步运行它，一个额外检查确认是 Python 3.15.0
Step 6 runs it, and an extra check confirms Python 3.15.0,

156
00:09:19,347 --> 00:09:22,335
来自 uv 的目录，而不是 image 自带的
from uv's folder, not the image's.

157
00:09:22,583 --> 00:09:27,400
第 7 步的 uv add 没找到新东西，因为两个包都已经列上了
Step 7's uv add finds nothing new, since both packages are listed;

158
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,517
它只写了 lock 文件
it only writes the lock file.

159
00:09:29,767 --> 00:09:33,122
第 8 和第 9 步：设置组名，这里是第 19 行
Steps 8 and 9: set the group name, here on line 19,

160
00:09:33,122 --> 00:09:36,082
再检查一下帮助，和 README 一致
and check the help, which matches the README.

161
00:09:36,402 --> 00:09:37,867
暂停一下，跟上进度
Pause and catch up.

162
00:09:37,917 --> 00:09:41,288
第 10 到 12 步：下载、生成、上传
Steps 10 to 12: download, generate, upload.

163
00:09:41,608 --> 00:09:46,275
生成这一步把每份转写文本发给 Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite
The generate step sends each transcript to Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite on Vertex AI.

164
00:09:46,275 --> 00:09:48,178
它跑在 Vertex AI 上
The generate step sends each transcript to Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite on Vertex AI.

165
00:09:48,498 --> 00:09:52,893
Google 在 2026 年 10 月 20 日下线该模型
Google retires that model on October 20, 2026.

166
00:09:53,213 --> 00:09:55,091
之后启动 container 时
After that, start the container

167
00:09:55,091 --> 00:09:58,120
要在 Gemini 模型变量里填一个现行的模型
with a current model in the GEMINI_MODEL variable.

168
00:09:58,440 --> 00:10:02,837
较新的模型在 cli.py 用的那个区域里没有提供
Newer models aren't served in the region cli.py uses,

169
00:10:02,837 --> 00:10:06,653
所以还要把第 24 行的区域改成 global
so also set the location on line 24 to global.

170
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:09,765
要找的是你的 prompt、Generated text
Look for your prompt, Generated text

171
00:10:09,765 --> 00:10:12,471
和一份很长的播客稿，然后是上传
and a long podcast script, then the upload.

172
00:10:12,791 --> 00:10:14,391
暂停一下，三步都跑一遍
Pause and run all three.

173
00:10:15,383 --> 00:10:18,881
第 13 步是退出并重新构建，修复也在这一步
Step 13, exit and rebuild, brings the fix:

174
00:10:18,881 --> 00:10:22,295
把最低 Python 版本降到 3.12
lower the minimum Python version to 3.12.

175
00:10:22,615 --> 00:10:25,198
而 git status 把 Dockerfile 也列出来了
Git status lists the Dockerfile too:

176
00:10:25,198 --> 00:10:27,351
这个目录没有 .gitignore
this folder has no .gitignore.

177
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,836
暂停一下，重新构建
Pause and rebuild:

178
00:10:30,836 --> 00:10:34,335
现在 uv sync 用的是 image 自带的 Python 3.12
uv sync now uses the image's Python 3.12,

179
00:10:34,335 --> 00:10:36,639
下一个 container 也一样
as does the next container.

180
00:10:36,959 --> 00:10:38,348
然后退出这个 container
Exit it.

181
00:10:38,398 --> 00:10:40,927
更好的办法是：在第一次构建之前就把它改好
Better still, fix this before your first build.

182
00:10:42,267 --> 00:10:44,400
快速过一遍：C、D 和 E
Speed round: C, D and E.

183
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:50,096
C 是 synthesis audio en：cd 进去，复制密钥，再跑 uv init
For C, synthesis_audio_en, cd in, copy the key, and run uv init.

184
00:10:50,416 --> 00:10:54,475
如果它写进去的是 3.13 及以上，就改成 3.12
If it stamps 3.13 or newer, change it to 3.12,

185
00:10:54,475 --> 00:10:56,240
这里和 D、E 都要改
here and in D and E.

186
00:10:56,484 --> 00:10:58,660
写一个和 B 一样的 Dockerfile
Write the same Dockerfile as B's.

187
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:03,548
一个小疏漏，这里和 E 都有：README 的正文说要保留 ffmpeg
A small slip, here and in E: the README's text says to keep ffmpeg,

188
00:11:03,548 --> 00:11:06,958
但它的代码块里没有 ffmpeg，这才是对的
but its code block, which is right, leaves it out.

189
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:12,212
构建它：构建步骤 2 用了缓存，整个构建只花了 0.6 秒
Build it: build step 2 is cached and the build takes 0.6 seconds:

190
00:11:12,212 --> 00:11:15,220
C 的 Dockerfile 到这里为止和 B 的一样
C's Dockerfile matches B's up to there,

191
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:17,611
所以 Docker 直接复用了 B 的那个大层
so Docker reuses B's big layer.

192
00:11:17,850 --> 00:11:22,202
运行它，加上 storage 和 text to speech：一共 24 个包
Run it, and add storage and text to speech: 24 packages.

193
00:11:22,450 --> 00:11:25,586
在第 18 行设置组名，然后检查一下帮助
Set the group name on line 18, then check the help.

194
00:11:25,906 --> 00:11:28,000
没有密钥的话，连帮助都会失败
Without a key, even help fails:

195
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:32,729
脚本一启动，第 22 行就创建 Text-to-Speech 客户端
line 22 builds the Text-to-Speech client as soon as the script starts,

196
00:11:32,729 --> 00:11:34,418
比读取任何参数都早
before reading any flags.

197
00:11:34,738 --> 00:11:36,338
暂停一下，跟上进度
Pause and catch up.

198
00:11:37,734 --> 00:11:42,150
请求里带着文本，还有 bucket 里的一个地址，就在第 78 行
The request carries the text and an address in the bucket, line 78.

199
00:11:42,470 --> 00:11:45,897
Google 的长音频服务把语音直接写到那里
Google's long audio service writes the speech straight there,

200
00:11:45,897 --> 00:11:47,526
从不经过你的 container
never through your container.

201
00:11:47,767 --> 00:11:51,357
C 只是拿着一张取件单，最多等 300 秒
C just holds a ticket stub for up to 300 seconds,

202
00:11:51,357 --> 00:11:56,194
然后打印出音频会被保存：所以 C 没有上传这一步
then prints that the audio will be saved: so C has no upload step.

203
00:11:56,434 --> 00:12:01,298
所以在 C 里，暂停一下，跑下载和合成，然后退出、重新构建
So in C, pause to run download and synthesis, then exit and rebuild.

204
00:12:02,284 --> 00:12:06,002
D，也就是 translate text，飞快地走完同样的准备
D, translate text, races through the same setup:

205
00:12:06,002 --> 00:12:09,644
cd、密钥、uv init、同样的 Dockerfile、构建
cd, key, uv init, the same Dockerfile, a build.

206
00:12:09,967 --> 00:12:12,554
然后运行它，加上 storage 和 translate
Then run it, add storage and translate,

207
00:12:12,554 --> 00:12:14,810
再在第 18 行设置组名
and set the group name on line 18.

208
00:12:15,130 --> 00:12:17,348
和 C 一样，连帮助都需要密钥
Like C, even help needs the key.

209
00:12:17,668 --> 00:12:19,268
暂停一下，跟上进度
Pause and catch up.

210
00:12:21,817 --> 00:12:23,926
翻译服务没有取件单
Translation has no ticket stub:

211
00:12:23,926 --> 00:12:28,957
法语直接返回，然后打印出来、存进 text translated
the French comes straight back, is printed and saved under text translated,

212
00:12:28,957 --> 00:12:30,557
所以 D 需要上传这一步
so D needs an upload.

213
00:12:30,700 --> 00:12:35,266
暂停一下，跑下载、翻译和上传，然后退出、重新构建
Pause to run download, translate and upload, then exit and rebuild.

214
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:38,316
至于 E，也就是 synthesis audio
E, synthesis audio,

215
00:12:38,316 --> 00:12:40,966
就是再来一遍 C，组名也在第 18 行
is C again, group name on line 18 too.

216
00:12:41,286 --> 00:12:42,540
一个无害的小疏漏
One harmless slip:

217
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:46,058
它的帮助文本写着 Transcribe audio file to text
its help text says “Transcribe audio file to text”,

218
00:12:46,058 --> 00:12:47,658
是从 A 的代码粘过来的
pasted from A's code.

219
00:12:47,878 --> 00:12:49,478
暂停一下，跟上进度
Pause and catch up.

220
00:12:52,017 --> 00:12:55,025
暂停一下，用你的密钥跑下载和合成
Pause, and run download and synthesis with your key.

221
00:12:55,700 --> 00:12:57,798
E 里有一个可选的附加任务
An optional bonus in E speaks the French with ElevenLabs, in the instructor's voice.

222
00:12:57,798 --> 00:13:01,097
用 ElevenLabs 以授课老师的声音念出法语
An optional bonus in E speaks the French with ElevenLabs, in the instructor's voice.

223
00:13:01,417 --> 00:13:04,456
它用的是你自己的 ElevenLabs 密钥和配额
It uses your own ElevenLabs key and quota:

224
00:13:04,456 --> 00:13:06,048
secrets 里放一个密钥文件
a key file in secrets,

225
00:13:06,048 --> 00:13:10,463
附加脚本里也要填上你的组名，还要 uv add requests
your group name in the bonus script too, and uv add requests.

226
00:13:10,700 --> 00:13:12,321
然后跑它的三条命令
Then run its three commands.

227
00:13:12,641 --> 00:13:18,231
没有密钥文件的话，连下载都会失败：脚本一启动就会读那个文件
Without the key file, even download fails: the script reads that file as soon as it starts.

228
00:13:18,467 --> 00:13:20,451
暂停一下，退出，然后重新构建 E
Pause to exit and rebuild E.

229
00:13:20,771 --> 00:13:23,460
五个都做完以后，你们组的抽屉一个个填满
With all five done, your group's drawers fill,

230
00:13:23,460 --> 00:13:25,507
排行榜上你那一行也会亮起来
and your leaderboard row lights up.

231
00:13:27,650 --> 00:13:29,613
关于密钥，最后一个问题
One last question about the key.

232
00:13:29,933 --> 00:13:32,685
它被 Git 忽略了，所以永远不会传到 GitHub
It's git-ignored, so it never reaches GitHub.

233
00:13:33,005 --> 00:13:36,079
可是你构建了 image，还把它 push 到了 Docker Hub
But you build the image and push it to Docker Hub:

234
00:13:36,079 --> 00:13:37,679
密钥在不在里面？
is the key inside?

235
00:13:46,033 --> 00:13:49,660
我们来验证一下，用一个 82 字节的替身文件代替真正的密钥
Let's test it, with an 82 byte stand-in for the real key.

236
00:13:49,980 --> 00:13:54,759
这几条额外的 Git 命令显示，它被 .gitignore 的第 3 行忽略了
These extra Git commands show it's ignored, by line 3 of .gitignore.

237
00:13:56,533 --> 00:14:01,696
现在重新构建，再列出 image 本身里面的 secrets 目录，不挂载
Now rebuild, and list the secrets folder inside the image itself, with no mount.

238
00:14:02,016 --> 00:14:06,090
就在这儿：mega-pipeline.json，在 image 里面
There it is: mega-pipeline.json, inside the image.

239
00:14:06,410 --> 00:14:09,620
你真正的密钥就在你今天构建的每个 image 里
Your real key is in every image you built today,

240
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:11,893
因为第 2 步在第 5 步之前
because step 2 came before step 5.

241
00:14:12,133 --> 00:14:14,266
Docker 不读 .gitignore
Docker doesn't read .gitignore.

242
00:14:14,586 --> 00:14:19,155
还记得第 2 讲的包裹吗：构建上下文就是整个目录
Remember lecture 2's parcel: the build context is the whole folder,

243
00:14:19,155 --> 00:14:22,565
密钥也在里面，COPY 那一行会把它全部拆开放进去
key included, and the copy line unpacks all of it.

244
00:14:22,885 --> 00:14:25,488
README 里关于 secrets 的提示只管 Git
The README's secrets note only covers Git.

245
00:14:25,733 --> 00:14:30,020
解决办法第 2 讲也推荐过，在这里算额外步骤
The fix, which lecture 2 recommended, is an extra here:

246
00:14:30,020 --> 00:14:34,074
一个叫 .dockerignore 的文件，只有一行：secrets/
a file named .dockerignore, with one line, secrets/.

247
00:14:34,394 --> 00:14:39,216
五个 image 都复制了密钥，所以暂停一下，在五个目录里都加上它
All five images copied the key, so pause and add it in all five folders.

248
00:14:40,683 --> 00:14:42,400
重新构建，再列一次
Rebuild, and list again:

249
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:45,334
报 cannot access，No such file or directory
cannot access, No such file or directory.

250
00:14:45,654 --> 00:14:47,361
密钥没有进 image
The key stayed out of the image.

251
00:14:48,050 --> 00:14:49,408
而运行照样没问题
And the run still works,

252
00:14:49,408 --> 00:14:53,597
因为挂载会在 container 启动时把你的 secrets 目录带进来
because the mount brings your secrets folder in when the container starts.

253
00:14:53,833 --> 00:14:58,392
README 最后那个可选部分，是把 image push 到 Docker Hub
The README's optional last section pushes the image to Docker Hub:

254
00:14:58,392 --> 00:15:02,260
先在那里创建一个访问令牌，然后登录、打 tag、push
create an access token there, then log in, tag and push.

255
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:05,993
只 push 用那个 .dockerignore 构建出来的 image
Only push an image built with that .dockerignore.

256
00:15:06,233 --> 00:15:10,669
登录时只给用户名，等它提示输入时再粘贴访问令牌
Log in with just your user name and paste the token at the prompt;

257
00:15:10,669 --> 00:15:13,358
令牌写在 -p 后面就会留在你的 shell 历史记录里
after -p it stays in your shell history.

258
00:15:13,678 --> 00:15:17,625
如果你曾经 push 过带密钥的 image，把它删掉，并告诉课程团队
If you ever pushed an image with the key, delete it and tell the staff.

259
00:15:17,867 --> 00:15:19,706
课程接下来的方向
Where the course is heading:

260
00:15:19,706 --> 00:15:23,711
去年的参考答案把 secrets 目录放在 repo 外面
last year's solution kept the secrets folder outside the repo

261
00:15:23,711 --> 00:15:26,272
运行时再把它挂载到 /secrets
and mounted it at /secrets at run time.

262
00:15:26,592 --> 00:15:28,640
密钥从来不会进入 image
No key ever enters the image.

263
00:15:29,983 --> 00:15:31,490
该清理了
Time to clean up.

264
00:15:31,540 --> 00:15:36,554
云上没有要删的东西：你没有创建任何机器、bucket 或账号
In the cloud there's nothing to delete: you created no machine, bucket or account.

265
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:39,808
在本地，用 cd .. 回到 repo 的根目录
Locally, cd .. back up to the repo.

266
00:15:40,128 --> 00:15:43,562
一条额外的命令列出这五个 image
An extra command lists the five images:

267
00:15:43,562 --> 00:15:50,517
transcribe audio 是 1.48 GB，其他四个各约 845 MB
transcribe audio at 1.48 gigabytes, the other four at about 845 megabytes each.

268
00:15:50,766 --> 00:15:52,566
想保住你的成果，就检查一下 Git
To keep your work, check Git.

269
00:15:52,814 --> 00:15:54,314
额外跑一下 git status
An extra git status

270
00:15:54,314 --> 00:15:58,903
它显示你改过的 cli.py 和 generate text 里的文件
shows your edited cli.py files and the files in generate text,

271
00:15:58,903 --> 00:16:04,014
但另外四个目录藏起了它们的 Dockerfile 和项目文件
but the other four folders hide their Dockerfiles and project files.

272
00:16:04,250 --> 00:16:05,692
在你自己的 repo 里
In your own repo,

273
00:16:05,692 --> 00:16:09,600
用 git add -f 把这些 Dockerfile 和项目文件加进去
add those Dockerfiles and project files with git add -f,

274
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:13,850
但别加数据目录，secrets 则要一直忽略下去
but not the data folders, and never stop ignoring secrets.

275
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:18,134
然后暂停，用 docker image rm 删掉这五个 image
Then pause and remove the five images with docker image rm,

276
00:16:18,134 --> 00:16:19,597
这也是额外步骤
another extra.

277
00:16:19,647 --> 00:16:23,483
旧的构建会留下来，没有 tag，每个都带着你的密钥
Older builds stay behind untagged, each holding your key,

278
00:16:23,483 --> 00:16:26,174
所以再用 docker image prune 把它们也删掉
so docker image prune removes those too.

279
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:31,205
五道自测题
Five questions to test yourself.

280
00:16:31,525 --> 00:16:35,536
第一题：D，也就是 translate text，读哪个抽屉，又是谁写的？
One: which drawer does D, translate text, read, and who wrote it?

281
00:16:35,856 --> 00:16:38,568
第二题：为什么挂载没有盖住那些包
Two: why doesn't the mount hide the packages,

282
00:16:38,568 --> 00:16:41,701
没有 uv project environment 这个变量，又会出什么问题？
and what breaks without UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT?

283
00:16:41,950 --> 00:16:44,972
第三题：在用完就扔的 container 里 uv add 之后
Three: after uv add in a throwaway container,

284
00:16:44,972 --> 00:16:47,859
什么会留下来，又是什么让它永久保留？
what survives, and what makes it permanent?

285
00:16:48,179 --> 00:16:52,574
第四题：哪个变量指向密钥，为什么只有在 /app 里才管用？
Four: which variable points to the key, and why only from /app?

286
00:16:52,894 --> 00:16:56,584
第五题：被 Git 忽略的密钥怎么会进 image，怎么修？
Five: how can an image hold a git-ignored key, and the fix?

287
00:16:56,833 --> 00:17:01,270
答案在练习里；每条命令都在学习指南里
Answers are in the exercises; every command is in the study guide.

288
00:17:01,590 --> 00:17:06,415
下节课：你自己的 bucket 和服务账号，放在 repo 外面的密钥
Next lecture: your own bucket and service account, the key outside the repo,

289
00:17:06,415 --> 00:17:09,526
还有一个帮你构建并运行每个 container 的脚本
and a script that builds and runs each container.
